  "checks": [
    "OnlineRoom has no legacy online-table fallback implementation",
    "Reduced motion removes camera travel while preserving the same hall and enabled action",
    "Persistent menu hall node, real intermediate camera transform, shared controls, glass handoff and intro keyboard gate",
    "Actual Electron create, six-seat lobby, 2/6-player intro and 33 cards across all three target viewports",
    "Online formal arena uses solo table image and shared camera/atmosphere; opening expansion is hidden",
    "Future limits 10→5→30 preserve current deadline and accepted move; host absence keeps cards/timers; naturally eliminated host can configure",
    "Last public table exits under glass before result; result returns to the same hall",
    "Submit confirmation lock, complete result last_turn, result-page settings, public reveal ledger and next-match lobby",
    "Host leave confirmation, indistinguishable access error, explicit full-room spectator choice, lobby role buttons",
    "Pending-close notice and hidden controls; directed removal navigates without a click, keeps identity, and late old event/snapshot do not restore old room",
    "Named IPC rejects URL injection and oversized input; native host-close cancellation preserves connection and confirmation exits",
    "Live solo and online arena backgrounds have matching rendered image, filter and atmosphere",
    "Ordinary main without endpoint reports unavailable; original offline worker starts, online switch rejects an active solo"
  ],
